	column KPI2_Beneficio_prueba = ```
			
			VAR I5 = 1.016222
			VAR _Valor = 
			    IF(
			        I5 > 1.2, 
			        1.5, 
			        IF(
			            I5 <= 0.8, 
			            0,
			            IF(
			                I5 <= 1,
			                5 * (I5 - 0.8),
			                1 + 2.5 * (I5 - 1)
			            )
			        )
			    )
			VAR _PesoTabla = 
			CALCULATE(
			    VALUES(RH_TablaKPI[Beneficio]), 
			    FILTER(
			        RH_TablaKPI, 
			        RH_TablaKPI[KPI] = RH_Planilla_BonoTrimestral[TKPI2] &&
			        RH_TablaKPI[Valor] = 1
			    ) 
			)
			
			RETURN
			    _Valor *_PesoTabla
			```
